{"id":"641132","name":"蟹黄馒头","author":"どら","authorId":"10454906","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/641132/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"低粉","amount":"500克"},{"name":"牛奶","amount":"260克"},{"name":"母的大闸蟹","amount":"一个"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母","amount":"3克"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"15克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"牛奶260克，加入酵母粉搅拌均匀。","img":"images/641132/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"倒入260克低粉，白糖20克。","img":"images/641132/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入大闸蟹蟹黄。","img":"images/641132/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"揉成光滑面团，放入不锈钢碗里。","img":"images/641132/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"盖锅盖发酵至两倍大。","img":"images/641132/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"如图所示，发酵好的面团。","img":"images/641132/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"分割成面团小剂子。","img":"images/641132/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"揉成光滑面团。","img":"images/641132/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入蒸锅，盖上锅盖，发酵30分钟，大火蒸二十分钟。","img":"images/641132/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"焖五分钟，取出来。","img":"images/641132/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/641132/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"早餐吃了没。","img":"images/641132/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品，早餐。","img":"images/641132/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}